# The patches in this directory apply to the Rust standard library's sources (the rust_nightly
# entry in build/deps/build_deps.jsonc), for the sanitizer-instrumented std build/rust builds.
# Registry crates are ordinary Cargo dependencies (deps/rust/Cargo.toml); patches to them live in
# crates/<crate>/, applied through crate.annotation() in build/deps/rust.MODULE.bazel.
exports_files(glob(["*.patch"]))
